    {
      "id": "github:212690136",
      "name": "Program Management Module (PMM)",
      "track": "open_source",
      "summary": "Salesforce Foundation 的 Program Management Module（PMM）是面向非营利组织的开源、免费 Salesforce 托管包：以 Program 为项目主记录，管理 Program 下的 Service、一次性/周期性 Service Schedule 与 Service Session、参与者/项目参与（Service Participant/Program Engagement），并按场次记录 Service Delivery 的出勤与数量，提供按 Program 汇总的服务交付报表。PMM 以 BSD-3-Clause 发布，但作为 Salesforce 平台上的完整业务模块运行，安装时自动带入闭源 SFDO Base，需 Salesforce org，不能独立自托管；开源许可仅覆盖 PMM 包。",
      "homepage": "https://salesforce.com/nonprofit/managed-packages",
      "repository_url": "https://github.com/SalesforceFoundation/PMM",
      "github_repository_id": 212690136,
      "license": "BSD-3-Clause",
      "license_evidence_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SalesforceFoundation/PMM/license",
      "features": [
        "Program 主记录：名称、开始/结束日期、Planned/Active/Completed/Canceled 状态",
        "Program 下的 Service 目录，每项服务带计量单位",
        "Service Schedule：一次性或按日/周/月重复的计划服务，并生成 Service Session",
        "Service Participant 与 Program Engagement：参与者报名、项目参与周期和阶段",
        "Service Delivery：按场次/服务记录出勤状态、数量、服务提供者与交付日期",
        "在 Service Session 上使用 Track Attendance 批量生成服务交付记录",
        "按 Program 汇总的 Services Delivered (Year to Date) 等内置报表"
      ],
      "deployment": [
        "Salesforce managed package，安装到 Salesforce org；需要 Salesforce 平台",
        "安装 PMM 时自动引入闭源 SFDO Base 包；PMM 包本身为 BSD-3-Clause",
        "不是独立自托管的服务器应用；本次未部署、未运行"
      ],
      "technology_stack": [
        "Apex",
        "Lightning Web Components",
        "Salesforce metadata / managed package"
      ],
      "verification_status": "official_sources_reviewed",
      "runtime_tested": false,
